    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing someone",
     "texto": [
      "**Uzun** means tall or long; **kısa** means short. **Saç** means hair and **göz** means eye.",
      "**Uzun saçlı** = with long hair; **mavi gözlü** = with blue eyes. The suffixes **-lı/-li/-lu/-lü** can mean «with» or «having»: **gözlü** (with eyes).",
      "**Saçı var** = he or she has hair; **gözlük** = glasses."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
